<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:05:45 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>PC Engine CD BIOS 开发日志：一条启动路径集成三种实验性服务，18 篇开发记录</title><link>https://dev.to/loach2009/pc-engine-cd-bios-devlog-three-experimental-services-in-one-boot-path-18-dev-entries-21nn</link><description>开源 PC Engine CD BIOS 替代项目本周从观测调用推进到实际执行三项实验性服务，开发 ROM 已实现 81 个候选入口中的 18 个。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:27:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">10e85ecb916bacb67f2bcbe1c5372fde7b4bba2a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/loach2009/pc-engine-cd-bios-devlog-three-experimental-services-in-one-boot-path-18-dev-entries-21nn">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Mali、Adreno 与 PowerVR 的 GPU 计数器数据能横向对比吗？</title><link>https://dev.to/gameoptim/can-you-compare-gpu-counter-data-across-mali-adreno-and-powervr-devices-3fkg</link><description>三家芯片厂商的计数器口径各不相同，同一读数在不同设备上含义也不一样，文章建议只拿同一台设备跟自己的历史数据比。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:31:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f68d07f1c57966a70877b8c961eeee3699f75ffa</guid><source url="https://dev.to/gameoptim/can-you-compare-gpu-counter-data-across-mali-adreno-and-powervr-devices-3fkg">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>在 Google Play 发布 Godot 游戏：封闭测试指南</title><link>https://dev.to/vmzavas/publish-a-godot-game-on-google-play-closed-testing-guide-4c39</link><description>从 Godot 导出签名 AAB、走 Play Console 封闭测试上架，手把手讲清新个人开发者账号发布游戏的完整流程。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:29:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">692f3022d21fd74299d88819a2a5cee1fee0a9b9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/vmzavas/publish-a-godot-game-on-google-play-closed-testing-guide-4c39">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>陀螺周报：《影之刃零》获金摇杆第二，黄仁勋辞职或波及游戏行业</title><link>https://www.youxituoluo.com/535060.html</l